{"content_hash": "1a47cf631d402422", "version_id": 624, "article_id": 63, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Paramount to turn Cyberpunk 2077 into a live-action film", "title_zh": "派拉蒙要把《赛博朋克2077》拍成真人电影", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "bbc_culture", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c60e048r02lgo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580617971627-cffa74e39d1d?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8dmlkZW8lMjBnYW1lJTIwY3liZXJwdW5rfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTE3NjYwNDJ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Jezael Melgoza on Unsplash", "author": "Jezael Melgoza", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@jezar?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/people-sitting-on-chair-in-front-of-table-2xBb36ebevg?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(88, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(126, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "dbb883523716"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-12", "word_count": 277, "reading_minutes": 1.4, "lead": "Paramount Pictures is developing a live-action movie based on the hit video game Cyberpunk 2077. The studio is working with producer Lorenzo di Bonaventura and the game's developer, CD Projekt Red.", "lead_zh": "派拉蒙影业正在开发一部改编自热门游戏《赛博朋克2077》的真人电影。片方将与制片人洛伦佐·迪·博纳文图拉以及游戏开发商CD Projekt Red合作。", "preview": "Paramount Pictures is developing a live-action film version of the hit video game Cyberpunk 2077. The Hollywood studio is working with produ", "preview_zh": "派拉蒙影业正在开发一部改编自热门游戏《赛博朋克2077》的真人电影。这家好莱坞片方将与制片人洛伦佐·迪·博纳文图拉以及CD Projekt Red（CDPR）合作。迪·博纳文图拉曾参与《变形金刚》系列电影，而CDPR是这款科幻角色扮演游戏的波兰开发商。CDPR联席首席执行官米哈乌", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 612, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/63/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 115.438, "size_bytes": 696384, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 318, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@aa22245/content/data/versions/624.json", "paragraphs": ["Paramount Pictures is developing a live-action film version of the hit video game Cyberpunk 2077. The Hollywood studio is working with producer Lorenzo di Bonaventura, who is known for the Transformers films, and CD Projekt Red (CDPR), the Polish developer behind the sci-fi role-playing game. CDPR's joint-chief executive Michał Nowakowski said the company was \"excited about Paramount as a future partner who shares our creative ambitions for the Cyberpunk franchise\".", "Details about the film's story, possible release date and casting have not yet been revealed. Despite a troubled launch in 2020, the game, which stars Keanu Reeves, has sold more than 40 million copies worldwide. The John Wick actor plays rockstar Johnny Silverhand, a terrorist whose consciousness is stored on a chip inside the body of the main character, V.", "Set in Night City, a fictional metropolis in a dystopian version of California, players try to uncover a conspiracy involving the shady Arasaka megacorporation. An expansion called Phantom Liberty, starring Idris Elba, was released in 2023 and has sold over 15 million copies, according to CDPR.", "Cyberpunk has already been adapted into a popular animated series, Edgerunners, whose second season is due to premiere on Netflix later this month. The streamer also produced The Witcher, based on CDPR's fantasy series. It originally starred Henry Cavill, but he was replaced by Liam Hemsworth in the fourth season.", "Many video game series have been turned into TV shows and films in recent years, with more on the way. Two Super Mario movies, a Minecraft film and several Sonic the Hedgehog films have each earned about $1bn worldwide. HBO's The Last of Us and Prime Video's Fallout were also hits."], "paragraphs_zh": ["派拉蒙影业正在开发一部改编自热门游戏《赛博朋克2077》的真人电影。这家好莱坞片方将与制片人洛伦佐·迪·博纳文图拉以及CD Projekt Red（CDPR）合作。迪·博纳文图拉曾参与《变形金刚》系列电影，而CDPR是这款科幻角色扮演游戏的波兰开发商。CDPR联席首席执行官米哈乌·诺瓦科夫斯基表示，公司“很期待派拉蒙成为未来的合作伙伴，它和我们一样对《赛博朋克》系列抱有创作雄心”。", "关于影片的剧情、可能的上映日期和选角等细节，目前尚未公布。尽管2020年发售时问题不断，这款由基努·里维斯参演的游戏全球销量已超过4000万份。这位《疾速追杀》主演饰演摇滚明星约翰尼·银手，他是一名恐怖分子，其意识被储存在主角V体内的一块芯片里。", "游戏背景设在夜之城，这是位于反乌托邦版加利福尼亚的一座虚构大都市，玩家要揭开一场涉及阴暗的荒坂巨型企业的阴谋。由伊德瑞斯·艾尔巴参演的扩展内容《往日之影》于2023年推出，据CDPR称销量已超过1500万份。", "《赛博朋克》此前已被成功改编为热门动画剧集《边缘行者》，其第二季将于本月晚些时候在Netflix首播。这家流媒体平台还制作了改编自CDPR热门奇幻系列的《猎魔人》。该剧最初由前超人演员亨利·卡维尔主演，但第四季中他被利亚姆·海姆斯沃斯取代。", "近年来，许多电子游戏系列被改编成电视剧和电影，还有更多项目正在筹备中。两部《超级马里奥》电影、一部《我的世界》电影以及多部《刺猬索尼克》电影的全球票房都达到了约10亿美元。HBO的《最后生还者》和Prime Video的《辐射》也都很受欢迎。微软如今成立了一个新部门，专门为旗下游戏授权拍摄电影和建设主题公园。"], "body": "Paramount Pictures is developing a live-action film version of the hit video game Cyberpunk 2077. The Hollywood studio is working with producer Lorenzo di Bonaventura, who is known for the Transformers films, and CD Projekt Red (CDPR), the Polish developer behind the sci-fi role-playing game. CDPR's joint-chief executive Michał Nowakowski said the company was \"excited about Paramount as a future partner who shares our creative ambitions for the Cyberpunk franchise\".\n\nDetails about the film's story, possible release date and casting have not yet been revealed. Despite a troubled launch in 2020, the game, which stars Keanu Reeves, has sold more than 40 million copies worldwide. The John Wick actor plays rockstar Johnny Silverhand, a terrorist whose consciousness is stored on a chip inside the body of the main character, V.\n\nSet in Night City, a fictional metropolis in a dystopian version of California, players try to uncover a conspiracy involving the shady Arasaka megacorporation. An expansion called Phantom Liberty, starring Idris Elba, was released in 2023 and has sold over 15 million copies, according to CDPR.\n\nCyberpunk has already been adapted into a popular animated series, Edgerunners, whose second season is due to premiere on Netflix later this month. The streamer also produced The Witcher, based on CDPR's fantasy series. It originally starred Henry Cavill, but he was replaced by Liam Hemsworth in the fourth season.\n\nMany video game series have been turned into TV shows and films in recent years, with more on the way. Two Super Mario movies, a Minecraft film and several Sonic the Hedgehog films have each earned about $1bn worldwide. HBO's The Last of Us and Prime Video's Fallout were also hits.", "body_zh": "派拉蒙影业正在开发一部改编自热门游戏《赛博朋克2077》的真人电影。这家好莱坞片方将与制片人洛伦佐·迪·博纳文图拉以及CD Projekt Red（CDPR）合作。迪·博纳文图拉曾参与《变形金刚》系列电影，而CDPR是这款科幻角色扮演游戏的波兰开发商。CDPR联席首席执行官米哈乌·诺瓦科夫斯基表示，公司“很期待派拉蒙成为未来的合作伙伴，它和我们一样对《赛博朋克》系列抱有创作雄心”。\n\n关于影片的剧情、可能的上映日期和选角等细节，目前尚未公布。尽管2020年发售时问题不断，这款由基努·里维斯参演的游戏全球销量已超过4000万份。这位《疾速追杀》主演饰演摇滚明星约翰尼·银手，他是一名恐怖分子，其意识被储存在主角V体内的一块芯片里。\n\n游戏背景设在夜之城，这是位于反乌托邦版加利福尼亚的一座虚构大都市，玩家要揭开一场涉及阴暗的荒坂巨型企业的阴谋。由伊德瑞斯·艾尔巴参演的扩展内容《往日之影》于2023年推出，据CDPR称销量已超过1500万份。\n\n《赛博朋克》此前已被成功改编为热门动画剧集《边缘行者》，其第二季将于本月晚些时候在Netflix首播。这家流媒体平台还制作了改编自CDPR热门奇幻系列的《猎魔人》。该剧最初由前超人演员亨利·卡维尔主演，但第四季中他被利亚姆·海姆斯沃斯取代。\n\n近年来，许多电子游戏系列被改编成电视剧和电影，还有更多项目正在筹备中。两部《超级马里奥》电影、一部《我的世界》电影以及多部《刺猬索尼克》电影的全球票房都达到了约10亿美元。HBO的《最后生还者》和Prime Video的《辐射》也都很受欢迎。微软如今成立了一个新部门，专门为旗下游戏授权拍摄电影和建设主题公园。", "text": "Paramount Pictures is developing a live-action film version of the hit video game Cyberpunk 2077. The Hollywood studio is working with producer Lorenzo di Bonaventura, who is known for the Transformers films, and CD Projekt Red (CDPR), the Polish developer behind the sci-fi role-playing game. CDPR's joint-chief executive Michał Nowakowski said the company was \"excited about Paramount as a future partner who shares our creative ambitions for the Cyberpunk franchise\". Details about the film's story, possible release date and casting have not yet been revealed. Despite a troubled launch in 2020, the game, which stars Keanu Reeves, has sold more than 40 million copies worldwide. The John Wick actor plays rockstar Johnny Silverhand, a terrorist whose consciousness is stored on a chip inside the body of the main character, V. Set in Night City, a fictional metropolis in a dystopian version of California, players try to uncover a conspiracy involving the shady Arasaka megacorporation. An expansion called Phantom Liberty, starring Idris Elba, was released in 2023 and has sold over 15 million copies, according to CDPR. Cyberpunk has already been adapted into a popular animated series, Edgerunners, whose second season is due to premiere on Netflix later this month. The streamer also produced The Witcher, based on CDPR's fantasy series. It originally starred Henry Cavill, but he was replaced by Liam Hemsworth in the fourth season. Many video game series have been turned into TV shows and films in recent years, with more on the way. Two Super Mario movies, a Minecraft film and several Sonic the Hedgehog films have each earned about $1bn worldwide. HBO's The Last of Us and Prime Video's Fallout were also hits.", "vocab": [{"word": "live-action", "pos": "adj", "zh": "真人实拍的", "note": "与动画、CG相对，指由真人演员出演", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "adaptation", "pos": "noun", "zh": "改编作品", "note": "动词是 adapt，常用搭配 an adaptation of", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "developer", "pos": "noun", "zh": "开发商", "note": "游戏开发公司；动词 develop", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "franchise", "pos": "noun", "zh": "系列品牌；IP", "note": "指可不断推出续作的商业系列", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "casting", "pos": "noun", "zh": "选角", "note": "为影视角色挑选演员", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "troubled launch", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "问题重重的发售", "note": "形容产品上市时状况不佳", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "dystopian", "pos": "adj", "zh": "反乌托邦的", "note": "描写黑暗、压抑的未来社会", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "conspiracy", "pos": "noun", "zh": "阴谋", "note": "常用搭配 uncover a conspiracy", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "megacorporation", "pos": "noun", "zh": "巨型企业", "note": "mega- 表示“巨大”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "expansion", "pos": "noun", "zh": "扩展内容；资料片", "note": "游戏新增内容的常用说法", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "premiere", "pos": "verb", "zh": "首播；首映", "note": "也可作名词，指首映式", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "box office", "pos": "noun", "zh": "票房", "note": "常用搭配 box office takings 票房收入", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "title_original": "Video game Cyberpunk 2077 to get live-action movie adaptation", "summary_original": "The smash hit from the studio behind The Witcher series is to be turned into a film by Paramount Pictures.", "body_original": "Video game Cyberpunk 2077 to get live-action movie adaptation\nBy\nTom Richardson\nBBC Newsbeat\nPublished\n9 October 2026\nA live-action movie version of smash hit video game Cyberpunk 2077 is being developed by Paramount Pictures.\nThe Hollywood studio is working with producer Lorenzo di Bonaventura, known for his work on the Transformers films, and CD Projekt Red (CDPR), the developer of the sci-fi role-playing game.\nCDPR's joint-chief executive Michał Nowakowski said in a statement\n,\nexternal\nthe company was \"excited about Paramount as a future partner who shares our creative ambitions for the Cyberpunk franchise\".\nDetails of the film's story, potential release date and casting information are yet to be revealed.\nDespite\na troubled launch in 2020\n, the Cyberpunk 2077 video game, which stars Keanu Reeves, has sold more than 40 million copies worldwide.\nThe John Wick star plays rockstar Johnny Silverhand, a terrorist whose consciousness is stored on a chip inside the body of main character V.\nSet in Night City, a fictional metropolis in a dystopian version of California, players work to uncover a conspiracy involving the shady Arasaka megacorporation.\nAn expansion, Phantom Liberty,\nstarring Idris Elba was released in 2023\nand has sold more than 15 million copies, according to CDPR.\nCyberpunk has already been successfully adapted into a popular animated series - Edgerunners - with a second season due to premiere on Netflix later this month.\nThe streamer also produced The Witcher, an adaptation of CDPR's massively popular fantasy role-playing series.\nIt originally starred former Superman actor Henry Cavill, but he was\nreplaced by Liam Hemsworth in the show's fourth season.\nMultiple video game series have been adapted for TV and film in recent years, with more due to follow.\nTwo Super Mario movies, a big screen version of Minecraft and a series of Sonic the Hedgehog films have each seen global box office takings of about $1bn.\nPlayStation game The Last of Us was made into a hit series by HBO, and Prime Video says its adaptation of post-apocalyptic role-playing series Fallout is one of its most-watched programmes.\nXbox maker Microsoft announced this week\n,\nexternal\nit had created a new \"XP\" division to focus on licensing its games for films, theme parks and other tie-ins.\nEarlier this week, Paramount Skydance completed\nits $110bn (£82.8bn) merger\nwith Warner Bros Discovery.\nIt's promised to release 30 films annually for the next two years, but also prompted\nfears over job losses and price rises for streaming services\nsuch as HBO Max and Paramount+.\nAdditional reporting by Peter Gillibrand.\nListen to Newsbeat\nlive\nat 12:45 and 17:45 weekdays - or listen back\nhere\n.\nRelated topics\nGaming", "fetched_at": "2026-10-12T00:47:20.989997", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Paramount", "s": 0.1, "e": 0.662, "sm": 100, "em": 662, "cs": 0, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Pictures", "s": 0.675, "e": 1.15, "sm": 675, "em": 1150, "cs": 10, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "is", "s": 1.163, "e": 1.275, "sm": 1162, "em": 1275, "cs": 19, "ce": 21, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "developing", "s": 1.288, "e": 1.85, "sm": 1287, "em": 1850, "cs": 22, "ce": 32, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "a", "s": 1.863, "e": 1.913, "sm": 1862, "em": 1912, "cs": 33, "ce": 34, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "live-action", "s": 1.925, "e": 2.625, "sm": 1925, "em": 2625, "cs": 35, "ce": 46, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "film", "s": 2.638, "e": 2.925, "sm": 2637, "em": 2925, "cs": 47, "ce": 51, "si